    <!--
      The three states of file access. They must stay separate: the `unsupported`
      row is greyed out (there is no system page to open on that device), while the
      `off` row is tappable. Collapsing them into one "Off" sends Android 10 users
      hunting for a setting that does not exist there.
    -->
